                  "Must be a valid Azure Virtual WAN resource ID, e.g. '/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/Microsoft.Network/virtualWans/{wanName}'."
                ]
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
]
